          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isho kanje iNkosi uJehova; Bhekani, nginalo ngokumelene nabelusi; futhi ngiyowufuna umhlambi wami esandleni sabo futhi ngibenze bayeke ukwelusa umhlambi; abelusi ngeke besazondla bona ngokwabo; ngokuba ngiyakusindisa umhlambi wami emlonyeni wabo, ungabi ngukudla kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokuba isho kanje iNkosi uJehova, ithi: Bheka, ngiyakuzihlola izimvu zami, ngizicinge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njengomalusi ebheka umhlambi wakhe mhla ephakathi kwezimvu zakhe ezihlakazekileyo; ngiyakuzifuna izimvu zami, ngizikhulule kuzo zonke izindawo ezihlakazekele kuzo ngosuku lwamafu nolumnyama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
