        },
        {
          "text": "Nina-ke mhlambi wami, isho kanje iNkosi uJehova, ithi: Bhekani, ngiyakwahlulela phakathi kwenkomo nenkomo, naphakathi kwezinqama nezimpongo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
